#
# Gives Code Monkey sessions on this repository sudo and Docker
# (lfreleng-actions/github-code-monkey-bot, docs/DESIGN.md section 4.1).
# Only this file's presence at the root of the default branch counts;
# the bot never reads its content.
#
# Why: this action drives docker buildx and reads Docker's image
# events to find what a build produced (scripts/). The unit tests use
# a fake docker, so a change cannot be checked against real BuildKit
# behaviour unless the session can build and run containers.
#
# The grant also gives the session the means to undo harden-runner, so
# remove this file once the repository no longer needs it.
